 114	   * git-audited like the rest of the schema; `lobu apply` folds it into the
 115	   * type's metadata_schema. A rule's `fields` are metadata keys or identity
 116	   * namespaces (e.g. `email`), `normalizer` is `email` | `phone` | `exact`, and
 117	   * `onMatch` is `auto_merge` | `review`. When the key is absent, `person`
 118	   * falls back to email/phone review rules; other entity types have no rules.
 119	   */
 120	  resolutionPolicy?: {
